---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import BentoTile from './BentoTile.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="ABOUT" title="The short version" />

    <div class="bento">
      <BentoTile span={4}>
        <h3 class="h3" class="mb-5">From wanting to be an inventor to building products</h3>
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="prose-body">
            I wanted to be an inventor before I knew what code was. The appeal never changed: take a problem, build the thing that solves it. High-school programming turned that itch into a craft — and I've been building ever since.
          </p>
          <p class="prose-body">
            I care about the product, not just the code. A clever backend nobody enjoys using isn't a win. I gravitate toward work where the experience matters — modern, polished, the kind of thing that makes someone go "oh, nice." That's why I call myself a product engineer, not a code-monkey.
          </p>
          <p class="prose-body">
            And I can't leave a bug alone. If I see one, it's getting squashed. That part's non-negotiable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </BentoTile>

      <BentoTile span={2}>
        <h3 class="h3" class="mb-5">At a glance</h3>
        <div class="stack">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm muted" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-1);">Education</p>
            <p class="text-sm">BSc Computer Science with AI, University of Nottingham</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm muted" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-1);">Focus</p>
            <p class="text-sm">Full-stack products &amp; AI tooling</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm muted" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-1);">Lately</p>
            <p class="text-sm">Infra (Terraform/AWS) &amp; agentic coding</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm muted" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-1);">Off the clock</p>
            <p class="text-sm">Anime, games, the gym</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </BentoTile>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
